sum= sum till now

rem= sum%D, can have value from 0 to D-1

recurrence
dp[indx][rem][flag] += dp[indx-1][newRem][newFlag]
--> range = flag==1 ? 9 : k[indx];
we put 0 to i at ans[indx-1]
    for i in 0 to range    
        --> newFlag = (!flag && k[indx]>i )|| flag ? 1: 0;

        --> newRem  =  (oldsum+i)%D = (rem+i%D)%D 
